# Runtime artifact root (ContextRepository filesystem adapter). Test and demo runs fill this with
# real transcript artifacts — memory CONTENT — and this repo is the OPEN one. Matches
# mu-client/.gitignore:36 and mu-server/.gitignore:8, which have always had the rule; mu-core did
# not, so 6884 artifact files sat one `git add .` away from a public commit.
.mu_data/
